/-!
# Local geometry of C₈ ⋊ (Z/8)ˣ

This interface collects the intrinsic geometry of the marked order-32 model:
the inner D₈ and elementary quotient, Frattini and derived subgroups, centers
and centralizers, normal cyclic-four subgroups, and the two inner Klein-four
subgroups with their conjugacy and normalizers. All identifications are actual
multiplicative equivalences, and the central quotient uses its canonical map.

Source: Aschbacher–Smith, *The Classification of Quasithin Groups*, pp.568–570.
Transport to Aut(A₆) requires a separate equivalence preserving the markings.
-/
